CVE-2026-40984 exp:2026-11-11

# CVE-2026-11822 / CVE-2026-11824 — sqlite-libs arbitrary code execution/crash via crafted
# FTS5 input, in the Alpine base image (transitive via eclipse-temurin:21-jre-alpine-3.23).
